# Plex and Jellyfin side by side, with Prometheus and Grafana (docs/cookbooks/observability.md).
# title: Everything
# needs: About 5 GB more memory (8 GB or more in all), and a free Plex account.
# asks: A playlist named plex, made on the Dashboard; a claim code from plex.tv/claim for Plex's first start; an API key from Jellyfin (KIA_JELLYFIN_TOKEN) for its dashboard; and your media folder (KIA_MEDIA_DIR), unless it's media/ in the kia folder.
# order: 7
KIA_STACK=plex,jellyfin,observability
